            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">Inventory for 1 MJ heat from biomethane, burned in a cogeneration unit with a capacity of 15 kWth. The multioutput process "biomethane, burned in cogen 15kWth delivers the coproducts "heat, at cogen 15kWth, biomethane, allocation exergy" and "electricity, at cogen 15kWth, biomethane, allocation exergy". The energy efficiency is 26% for electricity and 67% for heat. The economic factor is 0.72 for electricity and 0.28 for heat. This leads to the allocation factor of 0.5 for electricity and 0.5 for heat.;
Synonyms: Strom, ab BHKW 15kWth, Biogas, aufbereitet, ökonomische Allokation; 
